menu "Bestlink recorder"

config XVF_I2S_INPUT_RATE_HZ
    int "XVF3800 I2S input sample rate (Hz)"
    range 16000 48000
    default 48000
    help
        Set this to the sample rate produced by the installed XVF3800 I2S-master
        firmware. Supported values are 16000 and 48000. A 48 kHz input is
        downsampled to the required 16 kHz WebSocket PCM stream.

endmenu
